<ans># Care Health Insurance Ltd — 9MFY26 Financial Disclosure Summary

## Sourcing Note

Care Health Insurance Ltd is an **unlisted** entity — its holding company, Religare Enterprises, is listed, but Care Health itself does not publish a standalone investor-presentation deck. Consequently, **no 9MFY26 investor presentation exists** for this company, and all figures below are sourced directly from the company's statutory **IRDAI Quarterly Public Disclosure (NL returns)** for the period "Upto the Quarter ended 31st December 2025." Attempts to locate an alternative investor deck returned unrelated (Star Health) documents, confirming that the NL disclosure is the only available primary source for this period.

